{
  "schema": "zombiedefend-asset-group/1",
  "category": "ui",
  "group": "hud-kit",
  "title": "Unified UI Kit — HUD fonts, HP bars, panels, buttons, tip icons",
  "titleZh": "統一 UI 套件（字體／血條／面板／按鈕／提示圖示）",
  "description": "v0.22.0 UI kit from 2-PixelLab Bot. Stone/parchment/cyan-glow/orange-gem style matching title screen. Latin font atlases only (no CJK). Prefer ui-font-hud-bold-atlas-outlined and *-cream. Pet HUD stays under pets/ui. TTF companions: assets/library/ui/fonts/ui-font-hud-bold.ttf + ui-font-hud-tiny.ttf (not indexed as textures). Includes title splash ui-title-bg (688×384 native) + ui-title-bg-hd (1280×720 upscale) from 2-PixelLab Bot. v0.22.1: pet float GO!/Back! callouts under floats/. v0.22 Accept style fixes: stone enemy HP frame ui-hp-bar-enemy (118×24, origin 0.5,0.5) plus legacy ui-hp-bar-enemy-96 (96×32) and compact fills ui-hp-enemy-fill-{ok,mid,low} (72×8, origin 0,0.5); parchment/stone joystick ui-joystick-base (80×80), ui-joystick-base-96 (96×96), ui-joystick-knob and ui-joystick-knob-pressed (40×40), origin 0.5,0.5; clean title ui-title-bg-clean (688×384) and ui-title-bg-clean-hd (1280×720), origin 0.5,0.5, with no baked v0.21 footer and no NEW/LOAD/SCOREBOARD buttons. v0.26.1: digit cells 0–9 on the five HUD bitmap atlases redrawn so 0 (open ring), 1 (stem with top serif and base), and 6 (open top-right, holed bowl) stay distinct. Letters and punctuation unchanged. Grid stays 8×10. TTF companions not regenerated. Wave3 credit-burn panels live under ui/wave3/. Stage wave 3+ draws the 384×192 panels ui-hp-bar-player-wave3 and ui-hp-bar-barricade-wave3; waves 1–2 keep ui-hp-bar-player (248×36) and ui-hp-bar-barricade (251×45). Shop, title, pause, auth, banners, tip, pet select, gold chip, crit number, and the weapons row stay registered and are not drawn.",
  "source": {
    "tool": "2-PixelLab Bot ui-kit",
    "note": "Cataloged by PixelLab Asset Pipeline from /workspace/ui-kit"
